00:48:20.566 --> 00:48:21.070 align:middle line:90%
You guys will go in that room.

00:48:21.070 --> 00:48:22.850 align:middle line:90%
You guys stay out here.

00:48:22.850 --> 00:48:25.410 align:middle line:84%
